&lt;p&gt;As an Engineering Manager, Gitaly at GitLab, you&#39;ll guide a deeply technical team focused on building, maintaining, and providing expertise on Gitaly, GitLab&#39;s Git data storage tier. The team&#39;s work spans development of Gitaly, support for teams across GitLab, new tooling, scalability improvements, new data formats, and ongoing maintenance of the Gitaly codebase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a good fit for you if you can guide senior and staff engineers through complex, long-horizon technical work while building a culture of technical rigor, clear accountability, and ownership. You&#39;ll help the team balance roadmap delivery with GitLab product and infrastructure priorities, especially as much of the team&#39;s work is centered on scaling Git storage and adjacent foundational work. Clear written communication and thoughtful technical judgment are central to how this team succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Project areas include:&lt;/p&gt;
