&lt;li&gt;Good understanding and practical knowledge in cloud-based services (e.g. gRPC, GraphQL, Docker and Kubernetes, cloud services such as AWS, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketing domain building products that contribute to marketing tech stack&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with machine learning, recommender systems, product-led growth, or lifecycle marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience building distributed systems or a microservices architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Revenue and Financial Automation (RFA) organization at Stripe is building a modern, revenue-focused, financial management platform for fast-growing, digital-native companies.&amp;nbsp;Hundreds of thousands of businesses of all sizes and types use Stripe Billing to collect revenue for recurring and one-time payments across a variety of different pricing models—from selling SaaS subscriptions, to orchestrating multi-stage contracts, delivering Usage-Based Billing, and providing recovery and retention tools to prevent customer churn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The Metronome Infrastructure team builds and operates the infrastructure that Metronome product teams use to help users model and run their businesses. We own cloud infrastructure, container orchestration, databases, observability, deployments, and developer productivity. Working closely with Stripe Infrastructure, we scale our systems to support Stripe Revenue Suite’s rapid growth and help engineers build and ship faster through integrations with Stripe’s infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;kai-message-content-row&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;kai-message-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;⚙&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-kai-agent-message-content=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;kai-markdown&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Metronome Infrastructure team, you’ll build and scale the core systems our product teams rely on. Your work could include expanding database, network, or container orchestration capacity, or integrating AI tooling into our production stack across cloud infrastructure, observability, and deployments. You’ll take on startup-level ownership while collaborating across teams and drawing on Stripe’s deep technical expertise in operating at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain distributed cloud infrastructure and platform services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on scaling, automation, reliability, and observability of infrastructure services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate your services, debug issues, and support customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in roadmap planning and prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
