&lt;li&gt;BS (or higher) in Computer Science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of production level experience in one of: Python, Java, Scala, C++, or similar language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing &lt;strong&gt;large-scale distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in areas like Database replication, backup, transaction recovery at one of the major database vendors (Microsoft SQL Server , Oracle, IBM etc) is a plus to have.&lt;/li&gt;
