&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of leadership experience in Professional Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level understanding of PS&amp;amp;T offerings and the ability to customize solutions for complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient thought leadership, increasingly viewed as an external expert in the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the hiring process to attract top-tier talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Databricks architecture, ecosystem, and strategic account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 25-50% as required.&lt;/li&gt;
