&lt;li&gt;Shape APIs and developer experiences that make it easy for customers to ship AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers through design reviews and technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team externally through blog posts, talks, and open-source contributions to popular AI frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
