&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9342&quot; data-local-id=&quot;05b20079-dec7-44ee-940e-82377bb2ee03&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9414&quot; data-local-id=&quot;66d026db-d1b3-4f9e-9bd4-ba78c6503b77&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9491&quot; data-local-id=&quot;78ee56f2-dd8a-4b86-9336-f5666110b0fc&quot;&gt;Sales training in &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;MEDDIC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and Command of the Message&lt;/li&gt;
